        <mxCell id="legend" value="Legend&#10;─── Synchronous request flow (numbered 1-7) • Step 1 is dashed (out-of-band token issuance via make issue-token)&#10;- - - Asynchronous / out-of-band traffic (logs, metrics, HS256 secret fetch cached per Lambda container, image pulls, EC2 interruption events, External Secrets sync)&#10;Yellow callout = POC trade-off vs production&#10;Orange icons / containers = AWS managed services • Blue icons / dashed namespaces = Kubernetes objects (k8s icon pack)&#10;Single env: infra/envs/poc/ — hosts both weather-staging and weather-prod namespaces in one EKS cluster" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1">
